{"t": 209.17, "kind": "proposal", "iteration": 1, "k": 1, "move": "new_topology", "name": "Parallel_SSHI_FullBridge", "rationale": "The reference FBR fails in low-excitation (S4) and heavy-load (S2) conditions because the open-circuit voltage peak is too low to overcome the diode drops and reach the 1.8V target. A Parallel SSHI (Synchronous Switch Harvesting on Inductor) is used to flip the voltage across the piezo capacitance (Cp) at the peaks, effectively boosting the voltage available to the rectifier. A DZ33 Zener clamp is added to prevent overvoltage in S3, and a large storage capacitor will be optimized to reduce ripple and improve settling (dv).", "circuit": {"move": "new_topology", "name": "Parallel_SSHI_FullBridge", "rationale": "The reference FBR fails in low-excitation (S4) and heavy-load (S2) conditions because the open-circuit voltage peak is too low to overcome the diode drops and reach the 1.8V target. A Parallel SSHI (Synchronous Switch Harvesting on Inductor) is used to flip the voltage across the piezo capacitance (Cp) at the peaks, effectively boosting the voltage available to the rectifier. A DZ33 Zener clamp is added to prevent overvoltage in S3, and a large storage capacitor will be optimized to reduce ripple and improve settling (dv).", "done": false, "components": [{"id": "L1", "type": "L", "nodes": ["pzp", "n1"], "value": 0.001}, {"id": "S1", "type": "S", "nodes": ["n1", "pzn"], "ctrl": "G1"}, {"id": "G1", "type": "SYNC", "ton": 2e-05, "phase": 0.0, "edges": "both"}, {"id": "D1", "type": "D", "nodes": ["pzp", "out"], "model": "DSCH"}, {"id": "D2", "type": "D", "nodes": ["pzn", "out"], "model": "DSCH"}, {"id": "D3", "type": "D", "nodes": ["0", "pzp"], "model": "DSCH"}, {"id": "D4", "type": "D", "nodes": ["0", "pzn"], "model": "DSCH"}, {"id": "C1", "type": "C", "nodes": ["out", "0"], "value": 4.7e-06}, {"id": "DZ1", "type": "D", "nodes": ["0", "out"], "model": "DZ33"}]}}
